# `cargo build` writes the compiled module under target/; the shipped copy is the
# packaged one at units/mist-freenet/assets/slot-contract.wasm, written by
# scripts/build-slot-contract.mjs and pinned in scripts/freenet-binaries.json.
# Committing both would let them drift. (`build/` is where the old `fdev build`
# flow wrote; kept ignored so a stale checkout stays clean.)
/target
/build
